# MARKETPLACE

The marketplace is public.

But public does NOT mean all database data is public.

Only explicitly published inventory may be exposed.

Server-side eligibility: `public.face_is_marketplace_eligible(face_id)`.

Public reads: `marketplace_listings` and `marketplace_photos`.

Public writes: `submit_marketplace_enquiry(...)` only.

---

# ELIGIBILITY

A face is marketplace eligible only when:

board.lifecycle_status = active

AND face.marketplace_visible = true

AND face.publishable = true

AND mandatory compliance is valid

AND face is not blocked

`face_is_marketplace_eligible` currently treats mandatory compliance `expired` or `missing` as ineligible. `expiring` remains eligible.

Do not query `boards` / `board_faces` directly from the public app for listing pages.

---

# PUBLIC DATA

Allowed:

board photos
public board name
location
dimensions
direction
illumination
public rate (`card_rate`)
availability
available-from date

Never expose:

private documents
contracts
customer information
internal notes
internal operational information
tenant-private metadata
`floor_rate`

---

# SEARCH

Search must execute server-side.

Do not download the entire inventory into the browser.

Use:

pagination
filters
indexes
appropriate caching

---

# ENQUIRIES

Public enquiries must:

validate input
rate-limit
prevent abuse
create tenant-side enquiry
avoid exposing tenant identity unnecessarily

Use `submit_marketplace_enquiry`. Do not insert into `enquiries` from the browser as anon.
